{"type":"CSW_CAMPAIGN","campaignTitle":{"de":"Gamescom","en":"Gamescom"},"levels":[{"headline":{"de":"Ab zur größten Computerspielemesse!","en":"Off to the world's biggest gaming show!","fr":"Cap sur le plus grand salon de jeux vidéo !","es":"¡Rumbo a la mayor feria de videojuegos del mundo!","pt":"Rumo à maior feira de videojogos do mundo!"},"sublines":[{"de":"2 Personen · Dom-Vorplatz · Rhein-Überquerung","en":"2 persons · Cathedral square · Rhine crossing","fr":"2 personnes · Parvis · Traversée du Rhin","es":"2 personas · Plaza de la catedral · Cruce del Rin","pt":"2 pessoas · Adro da catedral · Travessia do Reno"}],"briefing":{"de":"Auf der Gamescom kam es zu einem Zwischenfall. Zwei verletzte Personen wurden auf dem Domplatz gemeldet. Transportieren Sie die Verletzten über den Rhein zur Koelnmesse. Der Landebereich ist markiert. Flotten Sie, Pilot.","en":"An incident occurred at Gamescom. Two injured persons have been reported on the Cathedral square. Transport the injured across the Rhine to the Koelnmesse. The landing zone is marked. Move fast, pilot.","fr":"Un incident s'est produit à la Gamescom. Deux blessés ont été signalés sur le parvis de la cathédrale. Transportez les blessés au-delà du Rhin jusqu'à la Koelnmesse. La zone d'atterrissage est balisée. Vite, pilote.","es":"Se ha producido un incidente en la Gamescom. Dos personas heridas han sido reportadas en la plaza de la catedral. Transporte a los heridos cruzando el Rin hasta la Koelnmesse. La zona de aterrizaje está marcada. Rápido, piloto.","pt":"Ocorreu um incidente na Gamescom. Duas pessoas feridas foram reportadas na praça da catedral. Transporte os feridos pelo Reno até à Koelnmesse. A zona de aterragem está marcada. Depressa, piloto."},"gridSize":70,"terrain":"3x39,10,21,36,48,56,58,57,58,62,71,78,83,86,87x5,84,81,76,71,67,65x2,61,53,43,29,15,6,4,3x38,5,17,21,34,47,55,58,59,61,65,73,80,84,86,87x2,88,89,90,89,87,83,78,73,71x3,68,62,50,32,13,4,3x38,4,12,19,27,38,47,52,54,58,64,71,78,82,83,84x2,8